{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621700/extras/33dba2fb09d2c6626abfaf4cd1534c0b.avif?t=1767688576\" width=1024 height=90 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>New Winter Update 3.0 is now available!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New themed maps for gameplay have been added.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character and bike customization is now open. Everything for your celebration!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unique Co-Op Bike Controls</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You share control between two players! Each has their own role. Cooperate, communicate, and play together\u2014because you have one goal!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One player controls the throttle, keeping you safe from deadly traps, while the other steers, finding the best path\u2014the path to the top!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Master teamwork, or the journey will be nearly impossible.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621700/extras/699aab6ba50039c953059923691a77e6.poster.avif?t=1767688576\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621700/extras/699aab6ba50039c953059923691a77e6.webm?t=1767688576\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621700/extras/699aab6ba50039c953059923691a77e6.mp4?t=1767688576\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Singleplayer and Co-Op!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is designed for cooperative play \u2013 you'll need a reliable partner who's ready to work as a team. Gather a friend, a relative, or just a brave soul who will share this challenge with you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>But if you want to test your skills alone - you are welcome!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621700/extras/1874e3dc8b645c0c9037bf8591163f71.poster.avif?t=1767688576\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621700/extras/1874e3dc8b645c0c9037bf8591163f71.webm?t=1767688576\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621700/extras/1874e3dc8b645c0c9037bf8591163f71.mp4?t=1767688576\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Test Your Friendship and Teamwork!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two friends decide to take on an unusual challenge\u2014a tandem bike race, that take place at huge height. But they never expected the road to the competition to be this dangerous and unpredictable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To make it to the top, you'll have to navigate through office buildings, busy highways, and even construction sites\u2014where every obstacle will test your teamwork.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>An unforgettable adventure filled with challenges and excitement awaits!</strong> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Grand Journey Through Ever-Changing Locations</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic landscapes and unexpected obstacles will keep you on your toes. From peaceful amusement parks to chaotic construction zones, every location is unique and demands a fresh approach.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You never know what\u2019s waiting around the next corner.</strong> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Challenge for Everyone</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Four difficulty levels let you choose your challenge:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Easy \u2014 </strong>a relaxed playthrough with frequent checkpoints.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Normal \u2014 </strong>the challenges get tougher, as checkpoints appear less often.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hard \u2014 </strong>only a few checkpoints across the entire map.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Insanity \u2014 </strong>no mercy and no checkpoints, pure focus and skill.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Are you ready to prove you can conquer any height?</strong></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"I hate portals","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3621700/16009d5b4dc9b15b3be0796addd958a5eac4e5ff.jpg"},{"name":"This is only the beginning","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3621700/16009d5b4dc9b15b3be0796addd958a5eac4e5ff.jpg"},{"name":"You\u2019ll definitely beat this?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3621700/4fffee52bc5a1723a4592019690d309e1c70ff32.jpg"},{"name":"Need more falls!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3621700/7cd10495de8752d556f107c6b6a8466491b9436b.jpg"},{"name":"Office plankton","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3621700/16009d5b4dc9b15b3be0796addd958a5eac4e5ff.jpg"},{"name":"We are builders","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3621700/16009d5b4dc9b15b3be0796addd958a5eac4e5ff.jpg"},{"name":"Need for speed","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3621700/16009d5b4dc9b15b3be0796addd958a5eac4e5ff.jpg"},{"name":"Just relax","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3621700/16009d5b4dc9b15b3be0796addd958a5eac4e5ff.jpg"},{"name":"Trailblazer","