b_paragraph\" >New themed maps for gameplay have been added.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character and bike customization is now open. Everything for your celebration!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unique Co-Op Bike Controls</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You share control between two players! Each has their own role. Cooperate, communicate, and play together\u2014because you have one goal!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One player controls the throttle, keeping you safe from deadly traps, while the other steers, finding the best path\u2014the path to the top!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Master teamwork, or the journey will be nearly impossible.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621700/extras/699aab6ba50039c953059923691a77e6.poster.avif?t=1767688576\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621700/extras/699aab6ba50039c953059923691a77e6.webm?t=1767688576\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621700/extras/699aab6ba50039c953059923691a77e6.mp4?t=1767688576\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Singleplayer and Co-Op!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is designed for cooperative play \u2013 you'll need a reliable partner who's ready to work as a team. Gather a friend, a relative, or just a brave soul who will share this challenge with you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>But if you want to test your skills alone - you are welcome!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621700/extras/1874e3dc8b645c0c9037bf8591163f71.poster.avif?t=176768