eckpoints across the entire map.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Insanity \u2014 </strong>no mercy and no checkpoints, pure focus and skill.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Are you ready to prove you can conquer any height?</strong></p>","developers":["Red Core Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621700/defa537fea0d08c31eab9d1828875b8a42fc1430/header.jpg?t=1767688576","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3621700/170126144/fd5a75afdf74b8865e55890fd33e40ed7944481a/1765788763/dash_av1.mpd?t=1765997980","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3621700/170126144/fd5a75afdf74b8865e55890fd33e40ed7944481a/1765788763/dash_h264.mpd?t=1765997980","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3621700/170126144/fd5a75afdf74b8865e55890fd33e40ed7944481a/1765788763/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1765997980","id":257249959,"name":"Try To Drive - Winter Update","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257249959/6781633441374a0d7e282cc323b419e8782da998/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1765997980"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3621700/1818247607/1ac70994c9a2e9b5493b13ddcadc2bd01cb35df3/1755184291/dash_av1.mpd?t=1755208829","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3621700/1818247607/1ac70994c9a2e9b5493b13ddcadc2bd01